{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116359","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116359/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116359/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116359/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116359","id":3948229428,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7EH41c","number":116359,"title":"GDScript: Add warning when exporting inner class resources","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2026-02-16T15:08:59Z","updated_at":"2026-07-12T10:11:53Z","closed_at":"2026-07-12T10:11:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116359","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116359","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116359.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116359.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116302\r\n\r\nIt's pretty common knowledge for more experienced users, that custom resources shouldn't be mixed with inner classes. While this is documented, there are too many ways for new users to try this out without encountering the necessary documentation.\r\n\r\nExtending `Resource` in inner classes is not always an issue if you know what you are doing and understand the limitations, so instead I opted to add a warning when exporting props that are typed with something that does not have a global type name. Doing this is always not a good idea and users should be made aware of it:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1001\" height=\"179\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/747760b6-924e-4943-bff0-457b84ccd288\" />\r\n\r\nIn addition to inner class resources the warning also triggers for preloaded types without `class_name`:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nconst Type = preload(\"./resource.gd\")\r\n@export var res: Type\r\n``` \r\n\r\nThose are not as critical as inner classes, but don't work correctly with the inspector (GDScript falls back to exporting them as `Resource` so the inspector can assign invalid values).\r\n\r\nThe warning also applies to `Nodes` since the same inspector issues apply.","closed_by":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116359/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116359/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}